'''Eldritch Forces''' is the final stage of the [[Stories of Legend]] campaign, and the only stage in [[Laboratory of Relics]]. [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] resides here and can be unlocked as a [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 100% chance when beating the stage. Clearing this stage unlocks the True Forms of all previous Stories of Legend Units and gives access to [[An Elder Secret (Merciless)|Growing Strange]], a stage that drops necessary associated materials. In addition, [[Ototo Corps|Ototo]] will be able to create Z-Materials. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

After clearing all other Stories of Legend sub-chapters on all Crown difficulties, the 4-Crown version of this stage will be unlocked. On completion, the stage is invaded by [[Idi:Re]] and becomes [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]], which reverts to normal when beaten.

