==Trivia==
*This is the only Stories of Legend stage to have [[No Continues]], a unique enemy base design and music, a guaranteed drop ([[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]], or [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]] in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Invasion]]), and an exclusive background.
*In the background of this stage, you can see [[Relic Doge]]s inside the containers.
*{{4c}} Eldritch Forces (and its [[Invasion Stage]]) can be accessed before the completion of its 2 and {{3c}} versions if all other Stories of Legend sub-chapters have been cleared on every difficulty beforehand. The button to select the {{4c}} difficulty will remain grayed out when viewing it even after finishing the stage, though will light up once the preceding difficulties have been cleared as usual.

